# Observability

Required in `docs/project/project.md` → Delivery requirements for L/XL and **Live** stage.

## Minimum bar

| Area | Requirement |
|------|-------------|
| **Logging** | Structured logs in server/API paths; no secrets in logs |
| **Errors** | User-facing messages safe; server logs useful context; no stack traces to clients |
| **Health** | Health/readiness endpoint for deployable services |
| **Errors (Live)** | Error tracking (e.g. Sentry) documented in `docs/project/setup.md` |
| **Deploy (XL)** | Post-deploy Playwright smoke against staging URL |

## Review triggers

- **security-reviewer** — log injection, PII in logs
- **performance-evaluator** — latency regressions when in issue rubric
- Record XL staging smoke in issue or release note

## Not required for

- Pure docs/harness changes
- S copy fixes with no runtime surface